Looks like the stream doesn't get unlocked in this code path. When doing lock/unlock semantics, it's best to have it be done using a `try/finally` block to guarantee we always call `UnlockStream`. Another option is to encapsulate the locking in a single function:
``` csharp
private void WithLockedStream(Action code)
{
    try
    {
        LockStream();
        code();
    }
    finally
    {
        UnlockStream();
    }
}
```
and then consumers can call via:
``` csharp
WithLockedStream(() =>
{
    // code that requires the stream to be locked
});
```
